+    "body": "Rollout proof for owner card t_01a1cedd5cab762d. State PR #1478 (merged as f590554f8a) installs the hub GitHub quota guard on pool workers through `worker-core-update` (`provision github-quota ... install-github-quota.py`). It is live and verified on worker-4. This card must run ON worker-1 (the ledger is per host).\n\nSteps (terminal, in this card's shell on worker-1):\n1. Check the guard is installed: `readlink ~/.local/bin/token-broker` must print `/home/ubuntu/.hermes/bin/token-broker-audit`, and `~/.local/bin/token-broker-unwrapped` must exist. If it's not installed yet, first confirm `git -C ~/.hermes/repos/hermes-state merge-base --is-ancestor f590554f8aa7663090b59dd71870c04eda6090fd HEAD` exits 0. Then run the same idempotent step the updater runs: `/usr/bin/python3 ~/.hermes/repos/hermes-state/hosts/hermes-workers/install-github-quota.py`. If the state clone doesn't have f590554f yet, wait for the next `hermes-core-update` pass (every 10 min), up to 30 min. Don't edit the checkout.\n2. Confirm card shells still work: `gh pr view 1478 -R example-org/hermes --json state` and, in a scratch dir, `git -c credential.helper= -c credential.helper='!~/.local/bin/gh auth git-credential' ls-remote https://github.com/example-org/hermes.git refs/heads/state` must both succeed.\n3. Guard proof: `token-broker exec --scope user/github --reason \"guard proof t_01a1cedd5cab762d\" -- gh api rate_limit --jq .resources.core`\n4. `sqlite3 -header ~/.hermes/logs/github-quota/audit.sqlite \"select id,fingerprint,reason,executable,exit_code,host,started from vends where reason='guard proof t_01a1cedd5cab762d'\"`. Also read the child request row: `select v.reason,r.method,r.endpoint,r.status,r.rate_limit_resource from vends v join requests r on r.vend=v.id where v.parent=(select id from vends where reason='guard proof t_01a1cedd5cab762d' order by started desc limit 1)`.\n\nComplete with metadata: `host`, `bundle` (the digest dir that `readlink -f ~/.hermes/bin/token-broker-audit` points into), `installed_by` (`updater` or `manual`), `vends_row` (the exact row text), `request_row`, `gh_pr_view_ok`, `git_ls_remote_ok`. If any step fails, do NOT uninstall unless card shells are broken. If they are, run `install-github-quota.py --uninstall`, then block with the error text. Don't change RESERVE or BURST_LIMIT.",
